# ==============================================================================
# QUARTUS ALLOWLIST: Ignore everything by default, only save essential source files
# ==============================================================================

# 1. Ignore absolutely everything by default
*

# 2. Allow Git to traverse into subdirectories to find your code
!*/

# 3. Allow essential Quartus project configuration files
!*.qpf
!*.qsf
!*.sdc

# 4. Allow VHDL source code and testbenches
!*.vhd
!*.vhdl

# 5. Allow documentation, text files, and Git rules
!*.md
!*.txt
!.gitignore
!*.pdf

# ==============================================================================
# HARD BLACKLIST: Never track anything inside these Quartus/Questa build folders!
# (Placed at the BOTTOM so they permanently override any allowlist rules above)
# ==============================================================================
db/
incremental_db/
output_files/
simulation/
